msgid "sect_mission_description"
msgstr ""
"Remain at your sect headquarters to take on patrol, guard, and internal sect"
" duties, then settle the outcome and rewards after several months."

msgid "sect_mission_requirements"
msgstr ""
"You must be a disciple of the sect and currently at your own sect "
"headquarters."

