msgid "action_setformation_short_name"
msgstr "Set Formation"

msgid "set_formation_action_name"
msgstr "Set Formation"

msgid "set_formation_description"
msgstr ""
"Set a formation in the current region. Requires an equipped formation disk "
"and consumes spirit stones. Each region can have only one active formation "
"at a time; a new formation replaces the existing one. The Spirit-Gathering "
"Formation increases breathing cultivation gains and suits cultivation "
"regions and sect headquarters. The Mountain-Guard Formation improves combat "
"capability within the formation and suits sect headquarters and cultivation "
"regions. The Healing Formation improves healing recovery and suits sect "
"headquarters, cultivation regions, and cities. The Clarity Formation "
"improves seclusion and breakthrough stability and suits cultivation regions "
"and sect headquarters. The Vein-Seeking Formation increases mining gains and"
" suits normal regions with mineral lodes. The Wood-Growth Formation "
"increases gathering gains and suits normal regions with plants. The Beast-"
"Driving Formation increases hunting gains and suits normal regions with "
"animals."

msgid "set_formation_requirements"
msgstr ""
"Requires an equipped formation disk, a valid location for the selected "
"formation, and enough spirit stones."

msgid "formation_spirit_gathering_name"
msgstr "Spirit-Gathering Formation"

msgid "formation_mountain_guard_name"
msgstr "Mountain-Guard Formation"

