# Story Styles
msgid "story_style.plain_narration"
msgstr ""
"Plain narration: Use restrained language and minimal embellishment, as if "
"recording events from the sidelines."

msgid "story_style.emotion_in_scenery"
msgstr ""
"Emotion through scenery: Let landscape and setting carry the feeling, "
"blending inner emotion into the scene."

msgid "story_style.freehand_ancient"
msgstr ""
"Freehand classical style: Favor imagery and metaphor; be concise and avoid "
"obscure archaic wording."

msgid "story_style.marketplace_life"
msgstr ""
"Marketplace life: Keep the prose grounded, colloquial, plain, and natural, "
"without affectation."

msgid "story_style.poetic_lyricism"
msgstr ""
"Poetic lyricism: Use short sentences and occasional parallel phrasing; "
"allude sparingly and avoid flowery excess."

msgid "story_style.philosophical_fable"
msgstr ""
"Philosophical fable: Let events raise a question or reveal one or two sharp "
"insights, without preaching."

msgid "story_style.chronicle"
msgstr ""
"Chronicle style: Recount events in clear order like a historian; use few "
"adjectives."

msgid "story_style.personified_scenery"
msgstr ""
"Personified scenery: Give the landscape a light touch of personification and"
" place aspirations in the view without overusing it."

msgid "story_style.taoist_nature"
msgstr ""
"Taoist nature: Tint the prose with accessible Daoist vocabulary and bring "
"the piece back to one central thought."

msgid "story_style.buddhist_emptiness"
msgstr ""
"Buddhist emptiness: Weave in impermanence and emptiness lightly, without "
"making the prose cryptic."

msgid "story_style.folk_storytelling"
msgstr ""
"Folk storytelling: Use the written voice of a lively storyteller, with brisk"
" pacing and vivid interest."

msgid "story_style.elegant_scholarly"
msgstr ""
"Elegant scholarly style: Maintain a learned atmosphere with a slight touch "
"of quotation, never showing off."

msgid "story_style.bold_and_open"
msgstr ""
"Bold and open: Use expansive words and majestic momentum; speak feelings "
"directly and without restraint."

msgid "story_style.gorgeous_and_bizarre"
msgstr ""
"Gorgeous and bizarre: Lean into sensory detail, ornate and alluring "
"language, and strange light and color."

msgid "story_style.cold_and_concise"
msgstr ""
"Cold and concise: Prefer short sentences; make every word count like metal "
"striking stone, with no surplus sentiment."

msgid "story_style.fine_line_drawing"
msgstr ""
"Fine line drawing: Add no decoration; catch subtle movement and expression "
"so the spirit emerges through precise detail."

